{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "month": "2026-10",
  "version": "0b19b995d557",
  "cards": [
    {
      "id": "2026-10-01",
      "date": "2026-10-01",
      "text": "因此这是一个优秀的人，同时也是一个十分普通的人，或者说他的优秀之处正是在于他以普通人的普遍方式生活着，兢兢业业地去承担命运赋予自己的全部责任，并且以同样的态度去品尝那些绵延不绝的欢乐和苦恼。",
      "author": "余华",
      "source": "音乐影响了我的写作",
      "category": "散文",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "type",
      "font": "xiaowei",
      "revision": 4,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/XJ6PaQ.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-33-073e2082bcc6.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-02",
      "date": "2026-10-02",
      "text": "听天，不会由命！",
      "author": "李信",
      "source": "王者荣耀",
      "category": "游戏",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "poster",
      "font": "wenkai",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/yRtUMw.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-23-6bd14e015e7e.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-03",
      "date": "2026-10-03",
      "text": "你要看很多书，从书中去寻找自己的影子，解释自己解释不了的事情，认识自己没有认识到的那一面。",
      "author": "刘媛媛",
      "source": "精准努力：刘媛媛的逆袭课",
      "category": "散文",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "book",
      "font": "xiaowei",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/0PJtZg.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-04-c9553aae960f.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-04",
      "date": "2026-10-04",
      "text": "我欲穿花寻路，直入白云深处，浩气展虹霓。",
      "author": "黄庭坚",
      "source": "水调歌头·游览",
      "category": "诗词",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "horizon",
      "font": "notosans",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/wqKGsQ.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-25-a1dffbe755cd.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-05",
      "date": "2026-10-05",
      "text": "我常在基督教堂外面看见“信，望，爱”。我不大懂那三个字的意思。今天我明白了：相信你自己的力量，盼望你不会死，爱你的国家！",
      "author": "老舍",
      "source": "四世同堂",
      "category": "散文",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "letter",
      "font": "wenkai",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/HGskxw.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-40-056916f9a682.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-06",
      "date": "2026-10-06",
      "text": "勇敢地，活下去吧。人不就是要这样死皮赖脸地活着吗？",
      "author": "水间ホシひと",
      "source": "樱花、萌放",
      "category": "游戏",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "collage",
      "font": "wenkai",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/k7kxtA.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-07-968a33c8a8bb.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-07",
      "date": "2026-10-07",
      "text": "人生苦短，终归尘土，凭什么仙家就可以遨游天地，而我等凡人只能做这井底之蛙？",
      "author": "忘语",
      "source": "凡人修仙传",
      "category": "动漫",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "light",
      "font": "notosans",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/1x2AFw.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-31-4841a7de2770.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-08",
      "date": "2026-10-08",
      "text": "苦难是一种命运，不应该被赞美，也不应该被埋怨。",
      "author": "李娟",
      "source": "记一忘三二",
      "category": "散文",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "excerpt",
      "font": "notoserif",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/McLSaw.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-db15182c6fa9fa6a99cdd24d6afe-0c9ad808e3ce.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-09",
      "date": "2026-10-09",
      "text": "山明水秀，风软云闲。一岩风景如屏，满目松筠似画。轻烟淡淡，数声啼鸟落花天；丽日融融，是处绿杨芳草地。",
      "author": "冯梦龙",
      "source": "醒世恒言",
      "category": "诗词",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "paper",
      "font": "notoserif",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/CPlaMA.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-22-5ea1c70e5f6d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-10",
      "date": "2026-10-10",
      "text": "湖光潋滟映苍穹，鱼跃清波沐夜风。对岸流莺闲不住，长歌戴月到江东。",
      "author": "徐清",
      "source": "浪淘沙·飞云湖月夜",
      "category": "散文",
      "background": "sea",
      "template": "split",
      "font": "notoserif",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/SCJz1Q.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/quiet-coast-09aa4adfcd5f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-11",
      "date": "2026-10-11",
      "text": "观花匪禁，吞吐大荒。由道反气，处得以狂。天风浪浪，海山苍苍。\n\n真力弥满，万象在旁。前招三辰，后引凤凰。晓策六鳌，濯足扶桑。",
      "author": "司空图",
      "source": "二十四诗品",
      "category": "诗词",
      "background": "sea",
      "template": "horizon",
      "font": "notosans",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/V9tBaA.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-21-ac26c9221322.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-12",
      "text": "我的唯一抉择，成为我宇宙的真理！",
      "author": "机甲战士欧格玛",
      "source": "坎公骑冠剑",
      "category": "游戏",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "poster",
      "font": "notosans",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/aXaoUQ.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-09-3dc122da8f7c.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-13",
      "date": "2026-10-13",
      "text": "最终阿安选择陪伴姥姥度过了最后的时光，当姥姥过世后，他才发现姥姥用了十几年为自己存了100万。",
      "author": "帕特·波尼蒂帕特",
      "source": "姥姥的外孙",
      "category": "台词",
      "background": "dusk",
      "template": "photo",
      "font": "wenkai",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/PJrgbg.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-11-99cc5057ba1c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-14",
      "date": "2026-10-14",
      "text": "有了喜欢的人就不可以和别人交往吗？即使那个人从不会回头看看我？",
      "author": "チチヅキ",
      "source": "咲き乱れるは百合の花",
      "category": "动漫",
      "background": "dusk",
      "template": "light",
      "font": "notosans",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/KTdzEA.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-03-4aefb9e00028.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-15",
      "date": "2026-10-15",
      "text": "不是要达到那个点，在其上人们不再说“我”，而是要达到这样一个点，在其上是否说“我”已经不再重要。",
      "author": "德勒兹",
      "source": "千高原",
      "category": "语录",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "excerpt",
      "font": "xiaowei",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/pWsvlg.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-1793792546422-852a19f8e2c6.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-16",
      "date": "2026-10-16",
      "text": "不为燥湿轻重，不为穷达易节。",
      "author": "班固",
      "source": "汉书",
      "category": "诗词",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "vertical",
      "font": "mashanzheng",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/XpE0IA.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-1793799217632-19fcfd1f0f6f.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-17",
      "date": "2026-10-17",
      "text": "在城市住久了，每要害起村庄的相思病来。我喜欢到村庄去，不单是贪玩那不染尘垢的山水；并且爱和村里的人攀谈。我常想着到村里听庄稼人说两句愚拙的话语，胜过在郡邑里领受那些智者的高谈大论。",
      "author": "许地山",
      "source": "落花生",
      "category": "散文",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "paper",
      "font": "wenkai",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/QUAm6g.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-32-45fcbca5f7e5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-18",
      "date": "2026-10-18",
      "text": "最近我很喜欢明天见这句话，因为只要许下约定，就能期待明天的到来。",
      "author": "结城友奈",
      "source": "结城友奈是勇者",
      "category": "动漫",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "collage",
      "font": "longcang",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/xumyVg.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-18-41a05ce888b7.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-19",
      "date": "2026-10-19",
      "text": "我闭上眼睛，努力让自己入睡，但心里始终盘旋着再过不久就要离开熙岭的事实。总有一天，这一瞬间会成为无人记得的遥远的过去，那时候，就没有祖母了。和祖母一起度过的那些时光将会成为只属于我自己的记忆。",
      "author": "崔恩荣",
      "source": "明亮的夜晚",
      "category": "小说",
      "background": "dusk",
      "template": "photo",
      "font": "longcang",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/KWlfaQ.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/rain-window-1880d108ec47.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-20",
      "date": "2026-10-20",
      "text": "盖牌认输永远不在选择之列。",
      "author": "凯德6号",
      "source": "命运2",
      "category": "游戏",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "poster",
      "font": "notosans",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/t2GRLA.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-35-b2e23608f1fd.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-21",
      "date": "2026-10-21",
      "text": "意义这二字是没有标准的，人生本没有意义，所有的意义是个人自己赋予的，你觉得有意义便有意义。",
      "author": "hasaki",
      "source": "一库",
      "category": "语录",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "type",
      "font": "xiaowei",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/tF1Xig.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-08-59f6f87d0f11.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-22",
      "date": "2026-10-22",
      "text": "人生就像一场戏，\n我们都是演员，\n关键是要演好自己的角色。",
      "author": "马丁·斯科塞斯",
      "source": "华尔街之狼",
      "category": "台词",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "excerpt",
      "font": "notoserif",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/89n6GQ.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-1793794949153-b342b5bf60b6.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-23",
      "date": "2026-10-23",
      "text": "人生有三次成长，一是发现自己不再是世界中心的时候；二是发现再怎么努力也无能为力的时候；三是接受自己的平凡并去享受平凡的时候。",
      "author": "周国平",
      "source": "周国平论人生",
      "category": "散文",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "book",
      "font": "xiaowei",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/18Kl4w.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-34-8e2ad1d00d7e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-24",
      "date": "2026-10-24",
      "text": "人生代代无穷已，江月年年望相似。",
      "author": "张若虚",
      "source": "春江花月夜",
      "category": "诗词",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "moon",
      "font": "wenkai",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/vOaVeQ.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-24-bfdf6de59e10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-25",
      "date": "2026-10-25",
      "text": "大家热爱的事物，擅长的事物都不同，都拥有自己的世界，一个人一个世界，这些互相连接的话，就会展开许多的可能性，广大、未知，就像是宇宙一样。",
      "author": "木之幡米拉",
      "source": "恋爱小行星",
      "category": "动漫",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "poster",
      "font": "wenkai",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/KSIqEw.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-36-b3a422a3f8d0.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-26",
      "date": "2026-10-26",
      "text": "老师，我们，像你这样的大人最讨厌了。",
      "author": "月雪宫子",
      "source": "蔚蓝档案 Vol.4卡班诺的兔子篇",
      "category": "游戏",
      "background": "dusk",
      "template": "light",
      "font": "notosans",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/VI4wbQ.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-06-b0f43fbd1ce4.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-27",
      "date": "2026-10-27",
      "text": "其实一家人，住在一个屋檐下，照样可以各过各的日子，可是从心里产生的那种顾忌，才是一个家之所以为家的意义。我这一辈子怎么做，也不能像做菜一样，把所有的材料都集中起来才下锅，当然，吃到嘴里是酸甜苦辣，各尝各的味。",
      "author": "李安",
      "source": "饮食男女",
      "category": "台词",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "split",
      "font": "notoserif",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/tRTGdw.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-12-55786b92929b.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-28",
      "date": "2026-10-28",
      "text": "生命之美，也不过是每个人都应该以符合其天性和职分的方式去行动。",
      "author": "路易斯·德·莱昂修士",
      "source": "路易斯·德·莱昂修士",
      "category": "语录",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "type",
      "font": "notoserif",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/3knuuA.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-10-4118047c78cc.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-29",
      "date": "2026-10-29",
      "text": "他觉得自己不适合这个仓促中选择的目标，感觉自己放弃的这个世界充满吸引力。他为自己的损失感到悲伤，也为父母的损失感到难过，他悲伤中甚至感觉自己在与他们拉开距离。",
      "author": "约翰·威廉斯",
      "source": "斯通纳",
      "category": "小说",
      "background": "dusk",
      "template": "photo",
      "font": "wenkai",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/KTdzEA.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-03-4aefb9e00028.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-30",
      "date": "2026-10-30",
      "text": "不要让时代的悲哀，成为你的悲哀。",
      "author": "会说话的肘子",
      "source": "第一序列",
      "category": "散文",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "letter",
      "font": "longcang",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/mAiJog.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/spring-hills-b45fb1070f09.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-31",
      "date": "2026-10-31",
      "text": "有安全的土地可供耕耘，有家人陪伴身旁，不必为生活担惊受怕，乱世中，平凡大众的奢望不过如此。",
      "author": "The New Order:Last Days of Europe",
